# JOURNEY · reading the ledger: every coin that moves lands on a line of /ledger (Ledger#show).
# Buy a Merluza, sell it back, and read the statement: the fish on the expense side, its sale on the
# revenue side, the net below. The stake the scene hands over is a godsend, a debug-mode line a player
# never sees, so the statement shows only what the player did.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/buy-a-fish.play Merluza Ann
run /shop
key down
key enter
select Ann (Merluza)
key enter
expect Sell Ann for $
key enter
key esc
key esc
absent Sell

run /ledger
expect Ledger#show
expect Revenue
expect Fish sales
expect Expenses
expect $126
absent Godsend
snap the sale and the purchase each land on their own line
key down 8
expect Net
snap the net is what the player made or lost
key esc
absent Ledger#show
